# Megascans pilot: the boulder NW_NATURE_STONE_BIGHIGH_01 by Lobart's farm and the forest floor around it.
# Run with OPENGOTHIC_CONTENT= for the original and with the pilot's staging set for the scans.
# Boulder at 16635 1765 -16057. In the wide shots the hero stands clear of it; in the others he is parked
# below the world, so the camera does not depend on the boulder's collision and pairs line up.
seed 73013
cheat god
overlay off
ui off
view nopfx
set time 12 0
goto pos 16635 2165 -15407
clear 3000
wait 2500
streaming wait 30000
wait 1500
cam look 120
cam cut
cam world 900 260 180
wait 60
cam hold
wait 900
shot wide_noon
wait 200
